ONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.3.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - Debian GNU/Linux trixie/sid trixie - X11 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 Ti (nvidia) - AMD Ryzen 5 4600HS with Radeon Graphics (12 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nBackground was made first, then it was duplicated, to create SecondFloorBelowBackground\r\nWhen I change the size of the Background/CollisionShape3D to match the size of the Background/CSGBox3D, SecondFloorBelowBackground/CollisionShape3D's size also gets changed.\r\nI think this can be regarded as a bug, because if we truly wanted the duplicates (of different sizes) to have the same collision box size, a scene could have been used.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1.  Load the Godot project.\r\n2. Open home_base.tscn\r\n3. Change the size of Background/CollisionShape3D to 50,50,0.5\r\n4. Change the size of SecondFloorBelowBackground/CollisionShape3D to 10,5,0.5\r\n5. Background/CollisionShape3D has now a size of 10,5,0.5\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug_report.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17708669/bug_report.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Syntrait","id":45499201,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDk5MjAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45499201?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Syntrait","html_url":"https://github.com/Syntrait","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Syntrait/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Syntrait/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Syntrait/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Syntrait/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Syntrait/